// Earth imagery source manifest. It records the offline-prepared presentation
// imagery hierarchy for Earth: one public-domain global overview and one bounded
// high-detail local region. The simulator never downloads imagery at runtime.
//
// This manifest is NOT accepted for rendering until every `source_sha256` and
// `runtime_sha256` is a real 64-character SHA-256 recorded during package
// production. The `pending` placeholders intentionally fail verification.
